OL,3,GNEWSASentencing of rejected boy who
OL,4,Astabbed girl 'appalling'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe parents of girls who were killed by
OL,7,Ftheir ex-boyfriends have described the
OL,8,Fsentencing of a teenager - who stabbed
OL,9,Fa girl multiple times because she did
OL,10,Fnot want to date him - as "appalling"
OL,11,Fand "disappointing".
OL,13,FThe 14-year-old boy stabbed the girl,
OL,14,Falso 14, multiple times with a 6in
OL,15,Fkitchen knife in Cirencester,
OL,16,FGloucestershire, in March - and
OL,17,Freceived a three-year restraining order
OL,18,Fon Monday.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
