OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSASentencing of rejected boy who
OL,4,Astabbed girl 'appalling'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCarole Gould and Nick Gazzard, whose
OL,7,Fdaughters were fatally attacked by
OL,8,Ftheir ex-partners, said the
OL,9,Fnon-custodial sentence highlighted the
OL,10,Fimportance of better education and law
OL,11,Fchanges around domestic abuse and
OL,12,Fcoercive control.
OL,14,FThe Ministry of Justice did not respond
OL,15,Fto a request for comment.
